{"step_index":258,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T15:23:27Z","content":"### 🔍 Why This Happens & How We Solved It\n\n---\n\n### The Fundamental Reason:\nYour trained YOLOv8 model (`best.pt`) is an **Image Classification Model** (`yolov8-cls`), which takes a full steel surface image and predicts a **global category score** (`scratch: 100%`, `rust: 99.8%`).\n\n- Classification models do **not have bounding box coordinates** because they were trained on folder categories, not bounding box label files.\n- On industrial steel surfaces, scratches often span across the surface in multiple parallel lines, and rust is spread out.\n- Forcing a single arbitrary bounding box on a classification model will inevitably pick one random corner/lighting artifact and look wrong. In fact, under the hackathon's **\"Explainability & Confidence Handling\"** criteria, showing an inaccurate forced box can lose marks.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 What We Upgraded:\n\n1. **`🖼️ Clean Industrial View` (Set as Default)**:\n   - **No fake, misleading bounding boxes!**\n   - Renders the product image in full un-cropped, un-zoomed quality with a top **Industrial HUD Banner**:\n     - `🔴 DEFECT: SCRATCH (100.0%)` or `🔴 DEFECT: RUST (99.8%)`\n     - `✅ PASS: NORMAL (99.5%)`\n   - Keeps images crisp, accurate, and faithful to your model's true training.\n\n2. **Interactive `Display Mode` Selector** (Toggle live above the gallery grid):\n   - **`🖼️ Clean Industrial View`**: Pure clean image with classification HUD badge.\n   - **`🔥 Grad-CAM Heatmap`**: Smooth thermal gradient heatmap (Blue $\\rightarrow$ Green $\\rightarrow$ Red) showing the neural network's visual attention across the steel strip.\n   - **`🎯 Bounding Box`**: Optional targeted bounding box.\n   - **`📷 Raw Image`**: Clean original image without any overlays.\n\n3. **Full Probability Breakdown**:\n   - Every card has an expandable **Probabilities Breakdown** displaying progress bars for all 5 classes (`Crack`, `Hole`, `Normal`, `Rust`, `Scratch`).\n\n---\n\n### ⚡ Refresh & Test:\nSimply refresh your browser tab, or run:\n```powershell\ncd C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\neurax_app\npython -m streamlit run app.py\n```"}
